            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "Sand Mix fills hairline to approximately 1/4\" cracks effectively. Wider cracks need a dedicated crack filler product — either a pourable crack sealant or backer rod plus sealant for very wide gaps. Fill cracks first, let cure 24 hours, then apply Sand Mix over the whole surface.",
