          <a href="#latex-ite-vs-henry-vs" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">7. Latex-ite vs. Henry vs. Blackjack: How They Compare</a>
          <a href="#diy-vs-professional-application" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">8. DIY vs. Professional Application</a>
          <a href="#our-verdict" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">9. Our Verdict</a>
          <a href="#faq" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">10. Common Questions</a>
