              <div>
                <p class="text-white font-bold mb-1">Airport Grade — for most driveways in most states</p>
                <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Best durability, best value, clean application on smooth asphalt. Accept the smell, apply in the morning, keep windows closed.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
